            <ArticleTitle>[Spontaneous perforation of the small intestine as rare cause of acute abdomen].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>605-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Spontaneous perforation of the small bowel as a cause of acute abdomen are seldom observed. In our patients 4 cases of non-traumatic perforation are reported. Compared with the international literature the incidence and different pathways of the perforation are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
